(122, 1, '2/4 Truck Load of Jarrah', '🔥 Win a FREE 2/4 Truck Load of Jarrah! 🔥\r\n\r\nWe’re giving away a FREE 2/4 truck load of premium Jarrah firewood.\r\n\r\nDraws are normally held weekly through our app. However, the app has not officially launched yet.\r\n\r\nWe are currently collecting permanent entries ahead of launch. All permanent entries gained through orders  will automatically remain valid for this draw and all future giveaways.\r\n\r\nThis draw is scheduled for one month from now to align with our official app release — once live, weekly draws will begin.\r\n\r\nGood luck and thanks for supporting us early 🔥', 'giveaway_images/1771150069_69919af5074eb.JPG', 790.00, 'bundle', 0, '2026-02-15', NULL, '2026-04-05', '2026-04-05', '20:00:00', 1, 'lottery_balls', '2026-04-05 20:00:00', '0', 1, NULL, 98, 0, '2026-04-05 14:00:06', NULL, '2026-02-15 10:07:49', '2026-04-05 14:00:06', NULL, 'manual'),
