(124, 3, '$100 OFF your next order.', '🔥 Win $100 OFF Your Next Firewood Order! 🔥\r\n\r\nWe’re giving away $100 OFF your next order — no catch, just straight savings.\r\n\r\nPerfect time to stock up on premium firewood and save.\r\n\r\nWe are currently collecting permanent entries ahead of our app launch, and every entry you earn now will carry forward into this draw and all future weekly giveaways.\r\n\r\n\r\nGood luck — and thanks for backing us early.', 'giveaway_images/1775452636_69d341dc96db6.png', 100.00, 'discount', 0, '2026-04-06', NULL, '2026-04-10', '2026-04-10', '20:00:00', 1, 'lottery_balls', '2026-04-10 20:00:00', '0', 1, NULL, 110, 0, '2026-04-10 14:00:06', NULL, '2026-04-04 01:57:35', '2026-04-10 14:00:06', NULL, 'manual'),
