(131, 9, '🔥 APP LAUNCH CELEBRATION GIVEAWAY 🔥', 'Celebrate the launch of the new JJ’s Firewood Perth app, we’re giving ONE lucky winner the chance to WIN a premium fireplace package valued at over $4,500 in partnership with Jarrahdale Heating & Cooling.\r\n\r\n🏆 PRIZE INCLUDES:\r\n• 1 x Innovator Wood Heater\r\n• 4m Black Flue Kit\r\n• Professional Supply & Installation\r\n• Removal of your old fireplace included\r\n\r\nThis premium Australian-made wood heater heats up to 232sqm and features a large panoramic viewing window, massive 580mm log capacity, and award-winning design built for Perth homes.\r\n\r\n📲 HOW TO ENTER:\r\n• Every app order automatically receives permanent giveaway entries\r\n• Want even more chances to win?\r\nYou can purchase EXTRA temporary entries directly inside the app for this exclusive draw.\r\n\r\nThe more entries you have, the better your chances.\r\n\r\n⚠️ APP EXCLUSIVE GIVEAWAY\r\n⚠️ LIMITED TIME ONLY\r\n⚠️ ONE WINNER ONLY\r\n\r\nThis is our biggest giveaway yet — and once it’s gone, it’s gone.\r\n\r\nPlease Note: We love sharing our winners with the JJ\'s Firewood Perth community. The winner may be invited to participate in photos, videos, or a short testimonial relating to the prize handover and installation. Any content shared may be featured on our website, social media pages, and future promotional material. Participation is appreciated and helps us continue bringing great giveaways to our customers.\r\n\r\nWe appreciate your patience and support as we continue expanding the JJ’s Firewood Perth app experience across Perth.', 'giveaway_images/1778321966_69ff0a2e9e90b.png', 4500.00, 'bundle', 0, '2026-05-09', NULL, '2026-06-05', '2026-06-05', '19:00:00', 1, 'lottery_balls', '2026-06-05 19:00:00', '0', 1, NULL, 158, 0, '2026-06-05 11:00:06', NULL, '2026-05-09 09:30:45', '2026-06-05 11:00:06', NULL, 'manual'),
(133, 10, '2/4 Truck Load of Jarrah', '🔥 WIN A FREE HALF TRUCK LOAD OF FIREWOOD! 🔥\r\n\r\nWe’re giving one lucky customer a FREE half truck load of quality firewood, delivered straight to their door! 🚚🔥\r\n\r\nThis giveaway is exclusive to the JJ’s Firewood app.\r\n\r\nEvery eligible order placed through the app during the giveaway period will automatically go into the draw.\r\n\r\nThe prize includes one half truck load of firewood delivered within our standard delivery area.\r\n\r\nThe winner may be contacted for photos or video of the delivery, which may be used for JJ’s Firewood advertising and promotional purposes.\r\n\r\nOrder through the app, get your entry, and you could be our next firewood winner.\r\n\r\nGood luck 🔥', 'giveaway_images/1771150069_69919af5074eb.JPG', 870.00, 'bundle', 0, '2026-04-05', NULL, '2026-06-12', '2026-06-12', '19:00:00', 1, 'lottery_balls', '2026-06-12 19:00:00', '0', 1, NULL, 234, 0, '2026-06-12 13:00:06', NULL, '2026-06-05 11:11:41', '2026-06-12 13:00:06', NULL, 'manual'),
(134, 11, 'Trailer Load of Firewood', 'We’re giving away a FREE 6x4 trailer load of quality firewood, delivered straight to one lucky winner.\r\n\r\nThis giveaway is part of our JJ’s Firewood App weekly draws, where every eligible order placed through the app earns a permanent entry into not just this draw, but every future weekly giveaway as well.\r\n\r\nThat means once you’re in, you stay in.\r\n\r\n✅ Free 6x4 trailer load of firewood\r\n✅ Delivered to the winner\r\n✅ App-exclusive giveaway\r\n✅ Permanent entries carry over into every weekly draw\r\n✅ More giveaways coming every week\r\n\r\nTo enter, simply place your order through the JJ’s Firewood app and you’ll automatically go into the draw.\r\n\r\nThanks again to everyone supporting the app and getting involved — we’re excited to keep giving back every week. 🔥', 'giveaway_images/1781261105_6a2be33156af0.png', 280.00, 'bundle', 0, '2026-06-12', NULL, '2026-06-19', '2026-06-19', '20:00:00', 1, 'lottery_balls', '2026-06-19 20:00:00', '0', 1, NULL, 2187, 0, '2026-06-19 14:00:07', NULL, '2026-06-12 10:39:03', '2026-06-19 14:00:07', NULL, 'manual'),
