(144, 21, '$100 OFF your next order.', '🔥 **WIN $100 OFF YOUR NEXT FIREWOOD ORDER!** 🔥\r\n\r\nWe\'re giving one lucky winner **$100 OFF** their next order with JJ\'s Firewood Supplies!\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re stocking up for winter or getting organised early, this is your chance to save big on quality firewood delivered straight to your door.\r\n\r\n🏆 **Prize:** $100 off your next firewood order\r\n\r\nGood luck from the team at JJ\'s Firewood Supplies! 🔥\r\n\r\n*Prize is redeemable against a future order. Not exchangeable for cash. Subject to giveaway terms and conditions.*', 'giveaway_images/1792055881_6ad09a49716d7.png', 100.00, 'discount', 1, '2026-10-15', '23:17:03', '2026-10-16', '2026-10-16', '20:00:00', 1, 'lottery_balls', '2026-10-16 20:00:00', '0', 1, NULL, 2097, 0, '2026-10-16 12:00:03', '2026-10-16 12:00:03', '2026-10-15 15:17:03', '2026-10-16 12:00:03', 3, 'pool'),
