jjsfirewoodperth.com.au/uploads/product_image/product_1769596808_20230602_124025.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 11, '2026-01-28 07:52:36', '2026-05-16 10:19:33'),
(47, 1, 13, 'Half Cage - (2 Scoops, HT)', 'Half cage of Premium Pure Jarrah- Long burn, solid heat, winter-ready', '300', 9861, '<p>This half cage of PURE premium Jarrah Firewood is the real deal. No blends, no fillers, just solid, dense hardwood built for serious heat and long-lasting burn times.&nbsp;</p><p>Jarrah is one of the most reliable firewood\'s around, known for producing strong coals and steady, consistent warmth that last well into the night. Perfect for fireplaces, wood heaters and slow overnight burns, Pure Jarrah burns hot and clean once established, making it an Aussie favourite for those who want maximum heat with less refuelling. IDEAL for cold winter evenings when you want a fire that holds its own!&nbsp;</p><p>To make things easy from the get-go, this purchase <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b>INCLUDES A FREE 24-PACK OF JIFFY FIRELIGHTERS</b></span>, so you\'re ready to light up straight away! What makes it even better, this deal <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b>ALSO INCLUDES- FREE DELIVERY TO ALL OF PERTH METRO</b></span>, saving you the hassle of loading, hauling and unloading, let us do it for you! (Stacking not included),</p><p><strong data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"351\">Please Note:</strong> Jarrah Only can sometimes come in larger pieces, which can be seen in the images provided. If you’d prefer smaller pieces, please let us know when ordering and we’ll do our best to accommodate your request. This cannot be guaranteed, as piece size depends on the stock available at the time.</p>', 'uploads/product_image/product_1793166244_$50 off (47).png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, '2026-01-28 10:23:10', '2026-10-28 05:44:04'),
(48, 1, 15, 'Half Cage - (2 Scoops, HT)', 'Budget Burner Firewood – Hot, Reliable & Great Value', '250', 9960, '<p data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"502\">This <strong data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"276\">Budget Burner firewood</strong> is a dependable, great-value option built for everyday heating without the premium price tag. Designed for regular winter use, it’s ideal for customers who want solid warmth, reliable burn times, and excellent value per load.</p><p data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"849\">Made up mainly of <strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"569\">well-seasoned hardwoods such as stringybark</strong>, Budget Burner lights easily and burns hot and steady once established. While it may burn slightly faster than premium Jarrah, it still produces strong heat and consistent performance, making it perfect for fireplaces, wood heaters, and frequent use throughout the colder months.</p><p data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"1070\">This option is especially popular with households that burn firewood often and want to keep heating costs down without sacrificing warmth. A practical, no-frills firewood choice that gets the job done night after night.</p><p>To make things easy from the get-go, this purchase <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b>INCLUDES A FREE 24-PACK OF JIFFY FIRELIGHTERS</b></span>, so you\'re ready to light up straight away! What makes it even better, this deal <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b>ALSO INCLUDES- FREE DELIVERY TO ALL OF PERTH METRO</b></span>, saving you the hassle of loading, hauling and unloading, let us do it for you! (Stacking not included),</p><p>A&nbsp;<span data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1188\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">TRUSTED, VALUE-DRIVEN FIREWOOD OPTION — PROPERLY SEASONED, RELIABLE HEAT, AND DELIVERED STRAIGHT TO YOUR DOOR.</span></p>', 'https://admin.jjsfirewoodperth.com.au/uploads/product_image/product_1769595902_6979e3fe4acff.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, '2026-01-28 10:25:02', '2026-