(49, 1, 14, 'Half Cage - (2 Scoops, HT)', 'Jarrah Bush Mix – Strong Heat, Easy Burn, Everyday Performer', '280', 9929, '<p data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"654\">This <strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"357\">Jarrah Bush Mix</strong> is a carefully balanced firewood option designed to deliver both long-lasting heat and dependable, easy-burning performance. Made up of a good mix of<strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"562\">&nbsp;premium Jarrah and selected bush hardwoods</strong>, it offers the perfect middle ground between premium heat output and everyday practicality.</p><p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"960\">Jarrah provides dense, long-burning coals and strong overnight warmth, while the bush mix helps the fire light faster and burn more responsively. This makes it an excellent choice for fireplaces and wood heaters, especially for households that want consistent heat without the higher cost of pure Jarrah.</p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1215\">Once established, this mix burns hot and steady with reliable performance throughout the night, making it ideal for regular winter use. It’s a versatile option that suits both high-usage homes and those looking for a dependable all-round firewood blend.</p><p>To make things easy from the get-go, this purchase <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b>INCLUDES A FREE 24-PACK OF JIFFY FIRELIGHTERS</b></span>, so you\'re ready to light up straight away! What makes it even better, this deal <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b>ALSO INCLUDES- FREE DELIVERY TO ALL OF PERTH METRO</b></span>, saving you the hassle of loading, hauling and unloading, let us do it for you! (Stacking not included),</p><p>A <strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1330\">PRACTICAL, WELL-BALANCED FIREWOOD OPTION — STRONG HEAT, EASY LIGHTING, AND DELIVERED STRAIGHT TO YOUR DOOR.</strong></p>', 'https://admin.jjsfirewoodperth.com.au/uploads/product_image/product_1769595906_6979e402897a0.jpg', NULL, NULL,