(50, 1, 15, 'Full cage - (4 scoops / 1T)', 'Budget Burner Firewood – Hot, Reliable & Great Value', '399', 997, '<p data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"475\">Our <strong data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"221\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\">full cage trailer load (4 scoops)</strong> of Budget Burner firewood is a practical, great-value option for customers wanting reliable heat without over-ordering. Designed for regular use and smaller households, it’s an ideal choice for topping up your firewood supply in one convenient delivery.</p><p data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"787\">Budget Burner firewood is made from well-seasoned stringybark, selected for its dense structure and dependable burn. Once established, it produces strong flames and steady warmth, making it well suited to fireplaces, wood heaters, and outdoor fire pits—perfect for winter heating or casual outdoor fire nights.</p><p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"1077\">Properly seasoned and ready to burn, this firewood lights easily, burns efficiently, and delivers consistent heat without the premium price tag. The <strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"967\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\">4-scoop cage trailer load</strong> is ideal for households wanting quality firewood for regular use without committing to a bulk truck delivery.</p><p data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1293\">This purchase <strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1142\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\">includes a FREE 24-pack of Jiffy firelighters</strong>, so you have everything needed from day one. It also <strong data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1247\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\">includes FREE delivery to all Perth Metro areas</strong>, removing the hassle of organising transport.</p><p data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"502\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1420\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">A straightforward, value-driven firewood option — reliable heat, seasoned and ready to burn, delivered straight to your door.</p>', 'https://admin.jjsfirewoodperth.com.au/uploads/product_image/product_1769596288_20220505_170305.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 4, '2026-01-28 10:29:51', '2026-05-15 12:01:27'),
(51, 1, 15, '2/4 Truck - (8 scoops / 2T)', 'Budget Burner Firewood – Hot, Reliable & Great Value', '650', 1000, '<p data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"502\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\"></div></p><div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:0e8b3d54-9836-4f71-9b5a-2223bed4e0bf-1\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-4\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"276405dd-3116-4e2c-8423-7e9471a391be\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"390\">The Budget Burner firewood is a reliable, great-value choice designed for everyday heating without the premium price. Perfect for regula