(54, 1, 14, '2/4 Truck - (8 scoops / 2T)', 'Jarrah Bush Mix – Strong Heat, Easy Burn, Everyday Performer', '740', 968, '<p data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"443\"><strong data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"162\">Jarrah Bush Mix – 2/4 Truck Load (8 Scoops)</strong> is a carefully balanced firewood option, designed to provide long-lasting heat and dependable, easy-burning performance. Made from&nbsp;<span data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"562\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">premium Jarrah and selected bush hardwoods</span>, it strikes the perfect balance between high-quality heat and everyday practicality.</p><p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"769\">The Jarrah component delivers dense, long-burning coals and strong overnight warmth, while the bush hardwoods help the fire ignite faster and burn more responsively. This makes it an excellent choice for fireplaces and wood heaters, particularly for households seeking consistent heat without the higher cost of pure Jarrah.</p><p data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"1026\">Once burning, this mix maintains hot, steady flames and reliable performance throughout the night, making it ideal for regular winter use. It’s a versatile option suited to both high-usage homes and those looking for a dependable all-round firewood blend.</p><p data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1318\">To make things simple from the start, this load <strong data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1125\">includes a FREE 24-pack of Jiffy firelighters</strong>, so you’re ready to light up immediately. Even better, it <strong data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1235\">includes FREE delivery to all Perth Metro areas</strong>, removing the hassle of loading, hauling, and unloading (stacking not included).</p><p data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1435\">A practical, well-balanced firewood option — <strong data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1433\">strong heat, easy lighting, and delivered straight to your door.</strong></p>', 'https://admin.jjsfirewoodperth.com.au/uploads/product_image/product_1769596825_6979e79960d46.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 3, '2026-01-28 10:40:25', '2026-07-25 08:44:59'),
(55, 1, 13, '2/4 Truck - (8 scoops / 2T)', '100% Jarrah – Premium Heat & Long Burn', '870', 930, '<p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"452\">This <strong data-start=\"212\" data-end=\"236\">Jarrah Only firewood</strong> is the real deal — <strong data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"294\">100% pure, premium Jarrah hardwood</strong> with no blends, no fillers, and no compromises. Properly seasoned and carefully selected, it’s built for serious heat output and long, consistent burn times.</p><p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"754\">Jarrah is one of Australia’s most reliable firewoods, known for producing dense coals and steady warmth that lasts well into the night. Once established, it burns hot and clean, making it ideal for fireplaces, wood heaters, and slow overnight burns when you want maximum heat with minimal refuelling.</p><p data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"502\">\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"958\">Perfect for cold winter evenings, this is the go-to choice for customers who want performance, efficiency, and reliability. A premium, no-nonsense firewood option that delivers exactly what it promises.</p><p>This purchase<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b> INCLUDES A FREE 24-PACK OF JIFFYS FIRELIGHTERS</b></span>, ensuring you have everything needed to get the fire going with ease. <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b>ALSO INCLUDED: FREE DELIVERY TO ALL OF PERTH METRO</b></span>, removing the hassle of transport and handling.</p><p><strong data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"349\">Please Note:</strong> Jarrah Only can sometimes come in larger pieces. If you’d prefer smaller pieces, just let us know when ordering and we’ll do our best to pick suitable stock. Please understand this isn’t always guaranteed, as it depends on what stock we have available at the time.</p>', 'uploads/product_image/product_1793165064_$50 off (44).png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 4, '2026-01-28 10:40:36', '2026-10-28 05:24:24'),
(56, 1, 14, '2.5/4 Truck - (10 scoops / 2.5T)', 'Jarrah Bush Mix – Strong Heat, Easy Burn, Everyday Performer', '870', 994, '<p data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"654\">This <strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"357\">Jarrah Bush Mix</strong> is a carefully balanced firewood option designed to deliver both long-lasting heat and dependable, easy-burning performance. Made up of&nbsp;<span data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"562\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">premium Jarrah and selected bush hardwoods</span>, it offers the perfect middle ground between premium heat output and everyday practicality.</p><p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"960\">Jarrah provides dense, long-burning coals and strong overnight warmth, while the bush mix helps the fire light faster and burn more responsively. This makes it an excellent choice for fireplaces and wood heaters, especially for households that want consistent heat without the higher cost of pure Jarrah.</p><p data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"502\">\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1215\">Once established, this mix burns hot and steady with reliable performance throughout the night, making it ideal for regular winter use. It’s a versatile option that suits both high-usage homes and those looking for a dependable all-round firewood blend.</p><p>This purchase<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b> INCLUDES A FREE 24-PACK OF JIFFYS FIRELIGHTERS</b></span>, ensuring you have everything needed to get the fire going with ease. <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"><b>ALSO INCLUDED: FREE DELIVERY TO ALL OF PERTH METRO</b></span>, removing the hassle of transport and handling.</p><p>A <strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1330\">PRACTICAL, WELL-BALANCED FIREWOOD OPTION — STRONG HEAT, EASY LIGHTING, AND DELIVERED STRAIGHT TO YOUR DOOR.</strong></p>', 'https://admin.jjsfirewoodperth.com.au/uploads/product_image/product_1769596996_6979e844de233.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 4, '2026-01-28 10:43:16', '2026-07-23 10:39:10'),
(57, 1, 13, '2.5/4 Truck - (10 scoops / 2.5T)', '100% Jarrah – Premium Heat & Long Burn', '1030', 997, '<p data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"432\">The <strong data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"206\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\">Budget Burner firewood – 2.5 truck load (10 scoops)</strong> is a reliable and budget-friendly heating option, ideal for everyday winter use. This mid-sized load is perfect for customers wanting dependable warmth, consistent burn performance, and strong value without the premium price.</p><p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"799\">Sourced mainly from well-seasoned hardwoods such as stringybark, Budget Burner firewood is easy to light and burns hot and steady once established. Although it burns a little faster than premium Jarrah, it still delivers excellent heat output and reliable performance, making it well suited to fireplaces, wood heaters, and regular use throughout the colder months.</p><p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"1049\">This option is particularly popular with households that use firewood often and want to keep heating costs manageable without compromising on warmth. A practical, no-frills firewood choice that does exactly what it’s meant to do, night after night.</p><p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1272\">This load <strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1111\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\">includes a FREE 24-pack of Jiffys firelighters</strong>, so you’re ready to get your fire going with ease.<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 231, 206);\"> <strong data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1222\">FREE delivery to all Perth Metro areas is also included</strong></span>, taking the hassle out of transport and handling.</p><p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"452\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1387\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"351\">Please Note:</strong> Jarrah Only can sometimes come in larger pieces, which can be seen in the images provided. If you’d prefer smaller pieces, please let us know when ordering and we’ll do our best to accommodate your request. This cannot be guaranteed, as piece size depends on the stock available at the time.</p>', 'uploads/product_image/product_1793158164_$50 off (44).png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 4, '2026-01-28 10:43:21', '2026-10-28 03:29:24'),
