(62, 2, 7, '40x 20KG Firewood Bags', 'Premium Firewood – 15–20kg Bags', '720', 999, '<p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"504\">These Jarrah Mix Firewood Bags contain a quality blend of Jarrah and mixed hardwoods, packed for convenience and reliable performance. Each bag weighs approximately 15–20kg depending on moisture content, making them a practical, easy-to-handle option without sacrificing heat output.</p><p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"504\">This Jarrah mix offers a strong, consistent burn with good coals and steady warmth once established. These bags are ideal for fireplaces, wood heaters, fire pits, and occasional use where convenience, value, and dependable performance matter.</p><p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"504\">Perfect for topping up your wood supply or for customers who prefer manageable bagged firewood, this is a convenient and reliable choice that delivers consistent heat and everyday performance.</p><p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"504\">A CONVENIENT, HIGH-QUALITY FIREWOOD OPTION — JARRAH MIX, CLEAN BURNING, AND READY TO USE.</p>', 'uploads/product_image/product_1792760139_$50 off (37).png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 9, '2026-01-28 10:57:40', '2026-10-23 12:55:39'),
(63, 2, 7, '50x 20KG Firewood Bags', 'Premium Firewood – 15–20kg Bags', '900', 999, '<p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"504\">These Jarrah Mix Firewood Bags contain a quality blend of Jarrah and mixed hardwoods, packed for convenience and reliable performance. Each bag weighs approximately 15–20kg depending on moisture content, making them a practical, easy-to-handle option without sacrificing heat output.</p><p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"504\">This Jarrah mix offers a strong, consistent burn with good coals and steady warmth once established. These bags are ideal for fireplaces, wood heaters, fire pits, and occasional use where convenience, value, and dependable performance matter.</p><p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"504\">Perfect for topping up your wood supply or for customers who prefer manageable bagged firewood, this is a convenient and reliable choice that delivers consistent heat and everyday performance.</p><p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"504\">A CONVENIENT, HIGH-QUALITY FIREWOOD OPTION — JARRAH MIX, CLEAN BURNING, AND READY TO USE.</p>', 'uploads/product_image/product_1792758019_$50 off (33).png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 9, '2026-01-28 10:59:03', '2026-10-23 12:20:19'),
(64, 3, 8, '10x 15KG Jarrah Kindling Bags', 'Premium Jarrah Kindling – 15KG Bags', '150', 980, '<p data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"525\">Our <strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"304\">kindling bags</strong> are packed with dry, easy-lighting kindling designed to get your fire going quickly and efficiently. Properly cut and well seasoned, this kindling ignites fast and helps establish a strong base flame with minimal effort.</p><p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"782\">Perfect for fireplaces, wood heaters, fire pits, and outdoor fires, these bags are ideal for pairing with firewood loads or keeping on hand for convenience. Whether you’re starting a fresh fire or reviving coals, quality kindling makes all the difference.</p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"844\">A <strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"844\">MUST-HAVE FIRE STARTER — CLEAN, DRY, AND READY TO USE.</strong></p>', 'https://admin.jjsfirewoodperth.com.au/uploads/product_image/product_1769598176_5cef5a8b-48fa-4291-bb66-a8d8ec65eed7.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 12, '2026-01-28 11:02:56', '2026-07-25 04:51:41'),
(65, 3, 8, '20x 15KG Jarrah Kindling Bags', 'Premium Jarrah Kindling – 15KG Bags', '280', 999, '<p data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"525\">Our <strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"304\">kindling bags</strong> are packed with dry, easy-lighting kindling designed to get your fire going quickly and efficiently. Properly cut and well seasoned, this kindling ignites fast and helps establish a strong base flame with minimal effort.</p><p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"782\">Perfect for fireplaces, wood heaters, fire pits, and outdoor fires, these bags are ideal for pairing with firewood loads or keeping on hand for convenience. Whether you’re starting a fresh fire or reviving coals, quality kindling makes all the difference.</p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"844\">A <strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"844\">MUST-HAVE FIRE STARTER — CLEAN, DRY, AND READY TO USE.</strong></p>', 'uploads/product_image/product_1769598192_6979ecf03e5db.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 12, '2026-01-28 11:03:12', '2026-07-12 07:24:18');
