(66, 3, 20, 'Jiffy 24 Pack Firelighters', 'These Jiffy Firelighters (24 Pack) are a reliable, easy-lighting solution designed to get your fire started quickly and with minimal effort.', '5', 994, '<p data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"465\">These <strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"236\">Jiffy Firelighters (24 Pack)</strong> are a reliable, easy-lighting solution designed to get your fire started quickly and with minimal effort. Each firelighter ignites fast and burns consistently, making them ideal for fireplaces, wood heaters, fire pits, and BBQs.</p><p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"688\">Simple to use and dependable, Jiffy Firelighters help establish a strong base flame so your firewood catches properly every time. A convenient, no-fuss fire-starting essential to keep on hand throughout the colder months.</p><p>\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"774\">A <strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"774\">TRUSTED FIRE STARTER — QUICK IGNITION, CLEAN BURN, AND READY WHEN YOU NEED IT.</strong></p>', 'uploads/product_image/product_1769598454_201104_TreeServe-Day-1_©RSM_0323LR.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 13, '2026-01-28 11:07:34', '2026-07-12 23:12:34'),
