(71, 1, 21, '3/4 Truck - (12 Scoops / 3T)', 'Dry Jarrah mill ends — premium hardwood offcuts, hot burning, long lasting and great value.', '750', 985, '<p data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"311\"><strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"195\">Jarrah Mill Ends – 3/4 Truck Load (12 Scoops / 3T)</strong> is a great value option for customers wanting genuine Jarrah hardwood without paying full premium firewood pricing.</p><p data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"497\">These are dry Jarrah offcuts from mill processing, so the pieces can vary in size and shape, but they still deliver the strong heat, dense coals and long burn time Jarrah is known for.</p><p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"764\">Perfect for fireplaces, wood heaters and winter heating, Jarrah Mill Ends are ideal if you want reliable hardwood warmth at a better price. This 3/4 truck load includes <strong data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"681\">12 scoops</strong>, making it a solid bulk option for regular home heating through the colder months.</p><p data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"377\">\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"802\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"802\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Delivered straight to your door.</strong></p>', 'uploads/product_image/product_1779838432_3207817047.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 4, '2026-05-22 03:28:43', '2026-06-29 00:00:25'),
(72, 1, 21, '2.5/4 Truck - (10 scoops / 2.5T)', 'Dry Jarrah mill ends — premium hardwood offcuts, hot burning, long lasting and great value.', '1030', 997, '<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"373\">Jarrah Mill Ends are a great value firewood option — made from genuine Jarrah hardwood offcuts with no softwood, no rubbish, and no unwanted mixed timber. Properly seasoned and ready to burn, they deliver the strong heat output and long-lasting coals Jarrah is known for.</p><p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"610\">Because these are mill ends, the pieces can vary in size, shape, and appearance, but that’s exactly what makes them such good value. You still get the heat and burn quality of Jarrah, without paying full premium split-firewood pricing.</p><p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"925\">Jarrah is one of Australia’s most reliable firewoods, known for producing dense coals and steady warmth that lasts well into the night. Once established, it burns hot and clean, making it ideal for fireplaces, wood heaters, fire pits, and slow overnight burns when you want maximum warmth with minimal refuelling.</p><p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1163\">Perfect for cold winter evenings, Jarrah Mill Ends are a smart choice for customers who want reliable hardwood heat at a better price. A no-nonsense firewood option that delivers strong performance, long burn times, and excellent value.</p><p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1402\">This purchase <strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1229\">INCLUDES A FREE 24-PACK OF JIFFYS FIRELIGHTERS</strong>, ensuring you have everything needed to get the fire going with ease. <strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1354\">ALSO INCLUDED: FREE DELIVERY TO ALL OF PERTH METRO</strong>, removing the hassle of transport and handling.</p><p data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"432\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1521\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1521\" data-is-last-node=\"\">A GREAT VALUE FIREWOOD OPTION — GENUINE JARRAH MILL ENDS, PROPERLY SEASONED, AND DELIVERED STRAIGHT TO YOUR DOOR.</strong></p>', 'uploads/product_image/product_1779420935_3207817045.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6, '2026-05-22 03:30:55', '2026-05-22 03:50:06'),
(73, 1, 21, '2/4 Truck - (8 scoops / 2T)', 'Dry Jarrah mill ends — premium hardwood offcuts, hot burning, long lasting and great value.', '550', 960, '<p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"373\">Jarrah Mill Ends are a great value firewood option — made from genuine Jarrah hardwood offcuts with no softwood, no rubbish, and no unwanted mixed timber. Properly seasoned and ready to burn, they deliver the strong heat output and long-lasting coals Jarrah is known for.</p><p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"610\">Because these are mill ends, the pieces can vary in size, shape, and appearance, but that’s exactly what makes them such good value. You still get the heat and burn quality of Jarrah, without paying full premium split-firewood pricing.</p><p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"925\">Jarrah is one of Australia’s most reliable firewoods, known for producing dense coals and steady warmth that lasts well into the night. Once established, it burns hot and clean, making it ideal for fireplaces, wood heaters, fire pits, and slow overnight burns when you want maximum warmth with minimal refuelling.</p><p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1163\">Perfect for cold winter evenings, Jarrah Mill Ends are a smart choice for customers who want reliable hardwood heat at a better price. A no-nonsense firewood option that delivers strong performance, long burn times, and excellent value.</p><p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1402\">This purchase <strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1229\">INCLUDES A FREE 24-PACK OF JIFFYS FIRELIGHTERS</strong>, ensuring you have everything needed to get the fire going with ease. <strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1354\">ALSO INCLUDED: FREE DELIVERY TO ALL OF PERTH METRO</strong>, removing the hassle of transport and handling.</p><p data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"452\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1521\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1521\" data-is-last-node=\"\">A GREAT VALUE FIREW